- **DLQ routing**: Handling invalid or malformed records
- **X-Ray tracing**: End-to-end observability across services
- **LocalStack testing**: Local integration testing strategy

## Code Example
```javascript
// Data masking function
function maskRecord(record) {
  const piiFields = ['userId', 'email', 'phone', 'ip'];
  const masked = { ...record.payload };

  piiFields.forEach(field => {
    if (masked[field]) masked[field] = 'REDACTED';
  });

  return {
    ...record,
    payload: masked,
    maskedHash: crypto.createHash('sha256').update(JSON.stringify(masked)).digest('hex')
  };
}
```

